# O3R - Ocular Oncology Outcomes Research

O3R is an ocular oncology outcomes research lab affiliated with the University of Calgary and University of Alberta. The lab builds outcome measures, evidence infrastructure, registries, and clinical tools for real-world eye cancer care.

